{"ticker":{"symbol":"038500.KQ","name":"삼표시멘트","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":5540.0,"change_pct":0.018382352941176405,"market_cap":594738675712.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.02184115523465704,"week52_low":2985.0,"week52_high":23500.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Samchok","employees":562,"website":"https://www.sampyocement.co.kr","business_summary":"SAMPYO Cement Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacture and distribution of cement in South Korea. The company offers Portland cement, blast furnace slag cement, and special-purpose cements, as well as clinker. It also exports its products to the United States, Japan, Africa, and other countries. The company was formerly known as TONGYANG Cement & Energy Corporation and changed its name to SAMPYO Cement Co., Ltd. in April 2017. SAMPYO Cement Co., Ltd. was founded in 1957 and is headquartered in Samchok, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"삼표시멘트(주)는 한국에서 시멘트를 제조 및 유통하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 클링커뿐만 아니라 포틀랜드 시멘트, 고로 슬래그 시멘트, 특수 목적 시멘트도 제공합니다. 또한 미국, 일본, 아프리카 및 기타 국가로 제품을 수출합니다. 회사의 전신은 동양시멘트에너지주식회사였으며 2017년 4월 삼표시멘트주식회사로 상호를 변경했습니다. 삼표시멘트주식회사는 1957년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 삼척에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"건축자재","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":721115587880.0,"operating_income":70175446250.0,"net_income":30189816650.0,"eps":281.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":823729443910.0,"operating_income":83979115280.0,"net_income":33819425300.0,"eps":315.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":790786523330.0,"operating_income":101989127170.0,"net_income":66107935280.0,"eps":616.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":676926715420.0,"operating_income":76974468170.0,"net_income":40810450730.0,"eps":380.0}],"price_history":[],"analyst":{"n_analysts":null,"rating":"","strong_buy":0,"buy":0,"hold":0,"se